  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jzFvQVgYwC\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/jzFvQVgYwC</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/879/619/re.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1677/852/arkane-domaims.png\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\"><strong>Теперь каждый биом — это домен, управляемый могущественным существом Аркана</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\"><strong>В каждом крупном обновлении в биом будет добавлен новый мощный босс, добавляющий сложный бой и множество лута</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif;font-size:24px\"><strong><strong>В этом новом обновлении...</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif;font-size:24px\"><strong><strong>(спасибо за 300 тысяч!!!)</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif;font-size:24px\"><strong><strong>СРАЖАЙТЕСЬ</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif;font-size:24px\"><strong><strong>С</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif;font-size:36px\"><strong><strong>КОЛДУНОМ</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif;font-size:24px\"><strong><strong>Правитель Снежных Равнин</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif;font-size:36px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1677/848/warlock_gggeo.gif\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\"><strong>ДИКИЙ ДРУИД</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\"><strong>Правитель Тайги&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1677/850/druidddddddddd.png\" width=\"415\" height=\"413\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1677/851/sin-tituloeeafefwe.png\" width=\"442\" height=\"129\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\"><strong><em>ПРОКЛЯТЫЙ ФАРАОН</em></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\"><strong>Правитель Пустыни</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1153/515/idlee.gif\" width=\"372\" height=\"245\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1153/519/itrems222.png\" width=\"343\" height=\"116\"></p>\n<p style